<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
        font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', sans-serif;
        background: #FDFAF6;
        color: #2C1A0E;
        font-size: 10.5px;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       BORDURE DÉCORATIVE EXTÉRIEURE
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .page-frame {
        border: 2.5px solid #C5A880;
        margin: 12px;
        padding: 0;
        min-height: 94%;
        position: relative;
    }

    .page-frame::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 5px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(197, 168, 128, 0.35);
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       EN-TÊTE OFFICIEL
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3A0000 0%, #5C0000 50%, #3A0000 100%);
        padding: 0;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #C5A880;
    }

    .header-inner {
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 18px 28px;
    }

    .header-left  { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; width: 60%; }
    .header-right { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; text-align: right; }

    .ornament     { color: #C5A880; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 6px; opacity: .7; }
    .logo-title   {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
        color: #C5A880;
        margin: 4px 0 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .logo-tagline { font-size: 8.5px; color: #C5A880; letter-spacing: 3.5px; opacity: .75; text-transform: uppercase; }

    .doc-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        border: 1.5px solid #C5A880;
        color: #C5A880;
        padding: 5px 14px;
        font-size: 9px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .header-meta  { font-size: 9px; color: #C5A880; opacity: .8; line-height: 1.8; }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       BANDE DE RÉFÉRENCE
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .ref-band {
        background: #F5EDE0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #C5A880;
        padding: 7px 28px;
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
    }
    .ref-band-cell { display: table-cell; font-size: 9px; color: #5C0000; letter-spacing: .5px; }
    .ref-band-cell:last-child { text-align: right; }
    .ref-label { font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: 5px; }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       CORPS — INTRO
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .body-wrap { padding: 16px 28px; }

    .section-title {
        font-size: 9px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8B0000;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #C5A880;
        padding-bottom: 5px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .section-title::before { content: '◆  '; font-size: 7px; }

    .intro-box {
        border: 1px solid #C5A880;
        background: #FFF8F0;
        padding: 11px 16px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        position: relative;
    }
    .intro-box::before {
        content: '❝';
        position: absolute;
        top: -8px;
        left: 14px;
        font-size: 22px;
        color: #C5A880;
        background: #FFF8F0;
        padding: 0 4px;
        line-height: 1;
    }
    .intro-text {
        font-style: italic;
        color: #4A2C0A;
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 10px;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       STATS — CADRES OFFICIELS
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .stats-row { display: table; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 16px; border-spacing: 0; }
    .stat-cell { display: table-cell; width: 33.33%; padding: 0 6px 0 0; }
    .stat-cell:last-child { padding-right: 0; }

    .stat-box {
        border: 1.5px solid #C5A880;
        background: #3A0000;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 12px 8px;
        position: relative;
    }
    .stat-box::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 3px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,.25);
    }
    .stat-num   { font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; color: #C5A880; line-height: 1; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 8px; color: #C5A880; opacity: .75; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 4px; }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       TABLEAU PRINCIPAL
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .table-wrap {
        border: 1.5px solid #C5A880;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 9.5px; }

    thead tr { background: #3A0000; }
    thead th {
        padding: 9px 8px;
        color: #C5A880;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: left;
        border-right: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,.4);
        font-size: 8.5px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: .8px;
    }
    thead th:last-child { border-right: none; }

    tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #FFF8F0; }
    tbody tr:nth-child(odd)  { background: #FFFFFF; }

    tbody td {
        padding: 7px 8px;
        border-right: 1px solid #EAD9C0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #EAD9C0;
        vertical-align: middle;
        color: #2C1A0E;
    }
    tbody td:last-child { border-right: none; }
    tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

    .td-index  { text-align: center; color: #8B0000; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9px; }
    .td-center { text-align: center; }
    .td-titre  { font-weight: bold; color: #3A0000; }
    .td-budget-high { color: #8B0000; font-weight: bold; }
    .td-statut { text-align: center; color: #1a5c38; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9px; }

    /* ligne de total */
    .tfoot-row { background: #5C0000 !important; }
    .tfoot-row td {
        color: #C5A880 !important;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 9px;
        border-color: #C5A880 !important;
        padding: 8px 8px;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       BLOC SIGNATURE
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .signature-section {
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sig-left  { display: table-cell; width: 55%; vertical-align: bottom; padding-right: 20px; }
    .sig-right { display: table-cell; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; }

    .sig-mention {
        border: 1px solid #C5A880;
        background: #FFF8F0;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        font-size: 9px;
        color: #4A2C0A;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .sig-mention-title {
        font-size: 8px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8B0000;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #C5A880;
        padding-bottom: 5px;
        margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .sig-box {
        border: 1.5px solid #C5A880;
        padding: 14px 18px 10px;
        background: #FFFFFF;
        position: relative;
    }
    .sig-box-label {
        font-size: 8px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8B0000;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    /* Signature manuscrite stylisée */
    .sig-name-cursive {
        font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', cursive;
        font-size: 22px;
        color: #3A0000;
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid #C5A880;
        padding-bottom: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .sig-contact-block { font-size: 8.5px; color: #5C0000; line-height: 1.8; }
    .sig-contact-block span { color: #8B0000; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 4px; }

    .sig-stamp {
        position: absolute;
        top: 10px;
        right: 14px;
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border: 2px solid #C5A880;
        border-radius: 50%;
        text-align: center;
        padding-top: 10px;
        font-size: 7px;
        color: #8B0000;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        font-weight: bold;
        line-height: 1.4;
        opacity: .8;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════
       PIED DE PAGE
    ══════════════════════════════════════ */
    .footer {
        background: #3A0000;
        border-top: 3px solid #C5A880;
        padding: 10px 28px;
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
    }
    .footer-left  { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; }
    .footer-right { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; text-align: right; }
    .footer-text  { font-size: 8px; color: #C5A880; opacity: .8; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .footer-brand { font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #C5A880; letter-spacing: 3px; }

    /* filigrane subtil */
    .watermark {
        position: fixed;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-35deg);
        font-size: 72px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: rgba(92, 0, 0, 0.04);
        letter-spacing: 8px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        pointer-events: none;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="watermark">DOURA MONDO</div>

<div class="page-frame">

    {# ── EN-TÊTE ── #}
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-inner">
            <div class="header-left">
                <div class="ornament">— ✦ —</div>
                <div class="logo-title">Doura Mondo</div>
                <div class="logo-tagline">Agence de Voyages de Luxe</div>
            </div>
            <div class="header-right">
                <div class="doc-badge">Document Officiel</div>
                <div class="header-meta">
                    Réf. DM-{{ date|date('Ymd') }}-VOY<br>
                    Édité le {{ date|date('d/m/Y') }} à {{ date|date('H:i') }}<br>
                    contact@douramondo.com
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# ── BANDE REF ── #}
    <div class="ref-band">
        <div class="ref-band-cell">
            <span class="ref-label">Objet :</span> Liste exhaustive des voyages proposés
        </div>
        <div class="ref-band-cell">
            <span class="ref-label">Établi par :</span> Zeyneb Chouchene &nbsp;|&nbsp;
            <span class="ref-label">Statut :</span> Confidentiel
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="body-wrap">

        {# ── INTRO ── #}
        <div class="section-title">Présentation</div>
        <div class="intro-box">
            <p class="intro-text">
                Doura Mondo vous propose une sélection de voyages d'exception soigneusement
                élaborés pour satisfaire les voyageurs les plus exigeants. Chaque destination
                fait l'objet d'une étude approfondie afin de garantir une expérience inoubliable,
                alliant découverte culturelle, confort et authenticité. Le présent document constitue
                un état complet de notre catalogue de voyages à la date d'édition.
            </p>
        </div>

        {# ── STATISTIQUES ── #}
        {% set totalPersonnes = 0 %}
        {% set totalBudget    = 0 %}
        {% for v in voyages %}
            {% set totalPersonnes = totalPersonnes + v.nbPersonnes %}
            {% set totalBudget    = totalBudget    + v.budgetEstime %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% set budgetMoyen = voyages|length > 0 ? (totalBudget / voyages|length)|round : 0 %}

        <div class="section-title">Synthèse chiffrée</div>
        <div class="stats-row">
            <div class="stat-cell">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <div class="stat-num">{{ voyages|length }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Voyages au catalogue</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-cell">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <div class="stat-num">{{ totalPersonnes }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Voyageurs accueillis</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-cell">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <div class="stat-num">{{ budgetMoyen|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} €</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Budget moyen</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# ── TABLEAU ── #}
        <div class="section-title">Détail des voyages</div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width:4%">#</th>
                        <th style="width:22%">Titre du voyage</th>
                        <th style="width:13%">Continent</th>
                        <th style="width:17%">Destination</th>
                        <th style="width:10%">Personnes</th>
                        <th style="width:10%">Durée</th>
                        <th style="width:13%">Budget estimé</th>
                        <th style="width:11%">Statut</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for voyage in voyages %}
                    <tr>
                        <td class="td-index">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                        <td class="td-titre">{{ voyage.titre }}</td>
                        <td>{{ voyage.continent }}</td>
                        <td>{{ voyage.destination }}</td>
                        <td class="td-center">{{ voyage.nbPersonnes }}</td>
                        <td class="td-center">{{ voyage.duree }} j.</td>
                        <td class="{{ voyage.budgetEstime > 5000 ? 'td-budget-high' : '' }}">
                            {{ voyage.budgetEstime|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} €
                        </td>
                        <td class="td-statut">✔ Actif</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                    <tr class="tfoot-row">
                        <td colspan="4">Total général</td>
                        <td class="td-center">{{ totalPersonnes }}</td>
                        <td class="td-center">—</td>
                        <td>{{ totalBudget|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                        <td class="td-center">{{ voyages|length }} actifs</td>
                    </tr>
                </tfoot>
            </table>
        </div>

        {# ── SIGNATURE ── #}
        <div class="section-title">Signature &amp; Validation</div>
        <div class="signature-section">

            <div class="sig-left">
                <div class="sig-mention">
                    <div class="sig-mention-title">Mention légale</div>
                    Ce document est établi à titre informatif et récapitulatif.
                    Les informations qu'il contient sont confidentielles et destinées
                    à l'usage exclusif de Doura Mondo. Toute reproduction ou diffusion
                    sans autorisation est interdite. Document généré automatiquement
                    par le système de gestion Doura Mondo.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="sig-right">
                <div class="sig-box">
                    <div class="sig-stamp">DM<br>{{ date|date('Y') }}<br>✦</div>
                    <div class="sig-box-label">Responsable du document</div>
                    <div class="sig-name-cursive">Zeyneb Chouchene</div>
                    <div class="sig-contact-block">
                        <span>Titre :</span> Directrice — Doura Mondo<br>
                        <span>Email :</span> zeyneb@douramondo.com<br>
                        <span>Date :</span> {{ date|date('d/m/Y') }}<br>
                        <span>Réf. :</span> DM-{{ date|date('Ymd') }}-VOY
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>{# fin body-wrap #}

    {# ── PIED DE PAGE ── #}
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-left">
            <div class="footer-brand">✦ DOURA MONDO ✦</div>
            <div class="footer-text">Agence de Voyages de Luxe &nbsp;|&nbsp; contact@douramondo.com</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-right">
            <div class="footer-text">
                © {{ date|date('Y') }} Doura Mondo — Tous droits réservés<br>
                Document confidentiel — Réf. DM-{{ date|date('Ymd') }}-VOY
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>{# fin page-frame #}

</body>
</html>
